    "type": "question",
    "label": "34",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following. $\\left(\\dfrac{2m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{8m^6}{n^9}$, $n\\ne0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{2m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3&=\\frac{2^3m^{2\\times3}}{n^{3\\times3}}\\\\\\left(\\frac{2m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3&=\\frac{8m^6}{n^9}\\end{align*}$$The original denominator requires $n\\ne0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
